        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Update MongoDB example to async/await (driver v5+)]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41102</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41102"/>
        <updated>2025-09-11T13:37:45.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87312278?u=2b9db5e595eb4dcc7261245265c2785c779aa60c&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Update the “Using databases” section in <code class="notranslate">Learn_web_development/Extensions/Server-side/Express_Nodejs/Introduction</code> to replace the deprecated callback-based MongoDB example with a modern async/await example.</li>
<li>Use the Promise-only MongoDB Node.js driver API (v5+) with explicit <code class="notranslate">connect()</code> and <code class="notranslate">close()</code>.</li>
</ul>

<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>The callback-based <code class="notranslate">MongoClient.connect</code> pattern is deprecated and removed in MongoDB Node.js driver v5+, which can confuse readers and no longer works with recent versions (e.g., <code class="notranslate">mongodb@6.x</code>, <code class="notranslate">Node.js v22</code>).</li>
<li>Using async/await reflects current best practices and ensures the sample code runs as-is.</li>
</ul>

<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>MongoDB Node.js driver v5+ change notes (Promise-only API): <a href="https://github.com/mongodb/node-mongodb-native/blob/HEAD/etc/notes/CHANGES_5.0.0.md#optional-callback-support-migrated-to-mongodb-legacy">https://github.com/mongodb/node-mongodb-native/blob/HEAD/etc/notes/CHANGES_5.0.0.md#optional-callback-support-migrated-to-mongodb-legacy</a></li>
<li>Legacy callback support package: <a href="https://github.com/mongodb-js/nodejs-mongodb-legacy#readme">https://github.com/mongodb-js/nodejs-mongodb-legacy#readme</a></li>
<li>Express “Database integration” doc reference (context): <a href="https://expressjs.com/en/guide/database-integration.html#mongodb" rel="nofollow">https://expressjs.com/en/guide/database-integration.html#mongodb</a></li>
</ul>

<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #40744.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3323695301" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40744" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/40744/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40744">#40744</a></p>



]]></content>
