<p dir="auto">Chrome 141 adds support for the <code class="notranslate">ariaNotify()</code> method; see <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5745430754230272" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5745430754230272</a>.</p>
