<p dir="auto">This PR adds:</p>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> A new <code class="notranslate">Document.ariaNotify()</code> page</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> A new <code class="notranslate">Element.ariaNotify()</code> page</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> A new <code class="notranslate">aria-notify</code> permissions policy directive page</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> Possibly a mention of it in a few other places, such as the ARIA live regions page.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Setting this to draft for now, as there are still some functionality details to be worked out in tests.</p>

