        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74417249?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Fixes the supported algorithms table.</p>
